# A losing race: START on the title, full throttle, but steering hard left
# from the green light, into the grass (slow) and the trees (crashes), so
# the clock runs out.
# gbcli run build/racer.gb --session lose --keys-file tools/lose.keys --until '[wState] == 3' --frames 3400
A@0
START@30 -START@32
LEFT@160
